{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Could not see.</b> Well enough so that his blessing could come upon them by his seeing them — as in תִּרְאֶנּוּ מִשָּׁם (Numbers 23:13), and as in וַיַּרְאֵהוּ ה' אֶת כָּל הָאָרֶץ (Deuteronomy 34:1) so that he might bless them, and likewise with Elisha: וַיִּפֶן אַחֲרָיו וַיִּרְאֵם (II Kings 2:24)." "<b>And he kissed them and embraced them.</b> So that his soul would cleave to them and his blessing would come upon them."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:35:07.581189472Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}